    {
      "title": "共学 D3：0.01 SOL 的第一笔真实 swap",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "计划是 devnet 模拟，结果成了 mainnet 真实交易。0.01 SOL 走 4 池多跳，Gas 仅 0.0000086 SOL。三个",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: 'SF Pro Text', -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #d7e1ee; background: #0b1020; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'SF Pro Text',-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#030712}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,rgba(34,197,94,.22),transparent 25%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#0b1020 48%,#111827 100%);color:#e5edf7;padding:64px 76px}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.65}\n.glow{position:absolute;right:74px;top:54px;width:220px;height:220px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.28);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.panel{position:relative;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(2,6,23,.72);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:38px 44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.toolbar{position:absolute;top:20px;left:24px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,.8)}\n.dot:nth-child(2){background:#38bdf8;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,189,248,.7)}\n.dot:nth-child(3){background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(245,158,11,.65)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#86efac;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.prompt{color:#22c55e;margin-right:10px}\n.title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16;color:#f8fafc;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a7b6c8;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}\n.chip{border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;color:#bbf7d0;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,monospace}\n.author{letter-spacing:1px}\n.scanline{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:62px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#22c55e,transparent);opacity:.75}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"cover\" data-cover-style=\"geek-black\">\n  <div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"tag\"><span class=\"prompt\">$</span>BUILD NOTES</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">共学 D3：0.01 SOL 的第一笔真实 swap（Jupiter API 全流程）</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">计划是 devnet 模拟，结果成了 mainnet 真实交易。0.01 SOL 走 4 池多跳，Gas 仅 0.0000086 SOL。三个坑：Jupiter 旧 API 下线、devnet 无池可路由、「客户端自报成功 ≠ 链上可查」。Python/Node/Rust 三版全链路跑通。</p>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">moonpub render</span><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div>\n    <div class=\"scanline\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">共学 D3：0.01 SOL 的第一笔真实 swap</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #111827; border: 1px solid #1f3a2e; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 3 天\n2026-08-07</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">计划里 D3 是\"第一笔 devnet swap\"，最后变成了 mainnet 真实小额 swap——中间踩了三个坑，每个都值得记下来。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#1f3a2e;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #22c55e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#0b1020;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#1f3a2e;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">坑一：Jupiter 旧 API 已下线/被墙</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">按计划先探测 Jupiter API 连通性。<code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">quote-api.jup.ag</code> 的 v6/v7 端点<strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">超时无响应</strong>——DNS 正常，但连接不通（中国网络被墙）。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">现行 API 是：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;background:#22c55e;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;letter-spacing:1px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;\">CODE</section>\n<section style=\"background:#020617;border:1px solid #1f3a2e;border-radius:0 6px 6px 6px;padding:16px;font-family:SF Mono,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#86efac;overflow-x:auto;\">\n<pre style=\"margin:0;\">https://api.jup.ag/swap/v1/quote   （Metis 路由引擎报价）\nhttps://api.jup.ag/swap/v2/build   （Router 路径，返回 raw instructions）</pre>\n</section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">而且从中国网络直连依然超时，<strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">必须走本机 Clash 代理 <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">127.0.0.1:7890</code></strong> 才能访问。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">坑二：Jupiter 只路由 mainnet，devnet 无池</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">quote 成功后想发 devnet swap——结果发现 <strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">Jupiter Swap API 只索引 MAINNET 流动性</strong>。devnet 上 program 和 USDC mint 都在，但 Metis 路由引擎不索引 devnet 的池子，无池可路由。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">结论：devnet 上没有现成池子，想练 devnet 得自己用 Raydium SDK 建测试池（工程量不小，留给后续）。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">决定：改走 mainnet 极小金额真实 swap</strong>——0.01 SOL（约 0.73 美元），风险可忽略。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">执行记录：quote → build → 签名 → 广播</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#111827;border:1px solid #1f3a2e;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#0b1020;border:1px solid #1f3a2e;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">步骤</span>1. quote</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">操作</span>0.01 SOL → 0.73 USDC</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">结果</span>minOut 0.72，slippage 1%</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#0b1020;border:1px solid #1f3a2e;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">步骤</span>2. build</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">操作</span>取交易指令</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">结果</span>computeBudget + 4 setup + swapInstruction（JUP6Lk...）+ 4 张 lookup table</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#0b1020;border:1px solid #1f3a2e;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">步骤</span>3. 组装+签名</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">操作</span><code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">@solana/web3.js</code> 组装 v0 transaction</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">结果</span>本地 <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">id.json</code> 签名（私钥不出本机）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#0b1020;border:1px solid #1f3a2e;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">步骤</span>4. 广播</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">操作</span>发送到 mainnet Helius RPC</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">结果</span>confirmed ✅</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">链上验证（二值判据）</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">tx</strong>: <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">27QRepQ1pewa8Y2YUfWEZJ5EGGiaaRRWgLko3Y4AxLFpvpiwj9PCVWQhkAZq6zze8giqxEtNck1QRNa7fQQ6Jid5</code></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">Solscan</strong>: <a href=\"https://solscan.io/tx/27QRepQ1pewa8Y2YUfWEZJ5EGGiaaRRWgLko3Y4AxLFpvpiwj9PCVWQhkAZq6zze8giqxEtNck1QRNa7fQQ6Jid5\" style=\"color:#22c55e;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #102a1d;word-break:break-all;\">https://solscan.io/tx/27QRepQ1pewa8Y2YUfWEZJ5EGGiaaRRWgLko3Y4AxLFpvpiwj9PCVWQhkAZq6zze8giqxEtNck1QRNa7fQQ6Jid5</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">路由</strong>：PancakeSwap → Meteora DLMM → AlphaQ → Deriverse（4 池多跳）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">Gas</strong>：0.0000086 SOL（约 0.0006 美元）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">钱包核对</strong>：SOL 0.201154956 → 0.191146329（扣 0.01 + fee 吻合）；USDC 29.5 → 30.226164（+0.726 与 quote 0.73 一致）</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">坑三：客户端自报成功 ≠ 链上可查</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">广播后客户端立刻返回 SUCCESS，但<strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">马上查 <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">getTransaction</code> 是 NOT FOUND</strong>——索引延迟约 3 秒，等几秒再查才成功。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这个教训很重要：<strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">「客户端自报」不能当「链上可查」的证据</strong>。验证必须用二值判据（tx hash 在 Solscan/链上存在才算数），这也是这几天共学一直在强调的方法论。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">同一流程，再写一遍：Rust 版</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">Python/Node 跑通后，把同一套链路用 <strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">Rust 重写</strong>（<code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">scripts/solana-rs/</code>，quote/build/swap 三子命令 CLI），加深对 Solana 执行层的理解：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">quote</code> / <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">build</code> 子命令走同一套 Jupiter 新 API</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">swap</code> 子命令组装 v0 交易（ALT）+ 签名 + bincode 序列化，默认 dry-run，<code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">--send</code> 才真发</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">真发验证成功</strong>：0.01 SOL → USDC，tx <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">3P8LZEoBz9FhQw52hycpNbAXPYzB6Qfg2NM8sjRhvdAidTVi3LsBfJSdcP3FZF3LAvsQb4DfEvpHwbWYCZg9aVS</code>，路由 Invariant → Aquifer，fee 7074 lamports（≈$0.0005），<code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">getSignatureStatuses = finalized</code></td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">顺手沉淀了 solana-sdk 2.x 的 API 迁移坑：<code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">Message::try_compile_v0</code> → <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">message::v0::Message::try_compile</code>、<code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">AddressLookupTableAccount</code> 移到 <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">solana_sdk::message</code> 顶层。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #111827; border: 1px solid #1f3a2e; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">Python + Rust 双实现并存：同一套逻辑，两种语言，互相印证。</section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">广度：Binance Web3 Trading API（币股套利数据源）</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">D3 还补了一个广度点——<strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">币股（tokenized stock）套利</strong>的官方数据入口。Binance Web3 Trading API 本质是 DEX 聚合器，一个入口覆盖多家发行方：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">双发行方</strong>：Ondo（type=1，始终 3-vendor RFQ）+ BStock（type=3，LiquidMesh SWAP + PcsXRfq RFQ 混合），代币集严格互斥</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">quoteId 有效期仅 30 秒</strong>：<code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">/quote</code> 后必须 30s 内 <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">/swap</code>，否则 <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">QUOTE_EXPIRED(40401)</code></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">非交易时段 API 直接拒绝</strong>：Ondo 40367、BStock 40369——\"闭市漂移\"窗口内官方 RFQ 不可用，套利只能走其他路径</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #f8fafc;\">RFQ 链路多 3 步</strong>：EIP-712 签名 → <code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">/order/submit</code> → 轮询 FILLED/FAILED，自动化门槛高但竞争者少</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这对\"同一股票多发行方价差\"（D 路线）的意义：数据接入已确认可行，监控脚本有了官方数据源。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#1f3a2e;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #22c55e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#0b1020;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#1f3a2e;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">产出</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">scripts/jupiter_swap_d3.py</code> — quote + build 流程（Python）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">scripts/swap_mainnet.mjs</code> — 完整签名+广播（Node）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">scripts/solana-rs/</code> — 同链路 Rust 版（quote/build/swap CLI，真发验证）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#020617;color:#86efac;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">solana-arbitrage</code> skill 更新：jupiter-swap-api-2026.md 端点表 + 实测结果</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #22c55e; border-bottom: 1px solid #1f3a2e; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">明天（D4）</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#102a1d;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#102a1d;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">价格监控脚本 v0：Helius RPC / Jupiter Quote API 拉 DEX 报价，Python 打印价差</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#0b1020;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#22c55e;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#0b1020;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">读 toll-fee-pool / premium-buyin-lp 群讨论 case</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#22c55e;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">扫码加入「寻月阁」共学群</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKazKVfrDpUTq1kFL4BKdD1IkxYPXqZjtd2thhwFVBJFMv8QD7KIV2mz5rmIX3Xb99Jn5pvNGtE7AsACiaeI1dq6GaicEywgupSF8k/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKaz5a4VeT7lxTkyyzK0Xe6Lm5D8sGtpHSotBaicabY522qKlEficlNbbUJwMNZrm5TcFfYic24k6tQ4mpY7UsWsicZKEoEBYWSe6erA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
  ]
}
